// ===================== library/anatomy.js — inside the human body, cartoon-textbook style (friendly, never gory) =====================
// Organs, senses and skin, bones and muscles, blood, cells and DNA, germs and defence, body systems, hormone molecules, body graphs.
// Complements body.js (brain, heart, lungs, eye, ear, tooth, skeleton, cell, neuron, DNA, blood cells, organs): this file makes what that one lacks.
